r-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">NameVerse features 50+ Christian baby names beginning with &quot;h&quot;. Each name comes with its authentic meaning, cultural origin, gender classification, and lucky number. Browse our complete list to discover traditional and modern Christian names for your baby.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">What do Christian names starting with &quot;h&quot; mean?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Christian names beginning with &quot;h&quot; carry rich cultural and spiritual meanings rooted in Biblical, Latin, and Christian traditions. Each name on NameVerse includes a detailed meaning explanation, helping parents choose a name with a beautiful and significant meaning.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">Are Christian names starting with &quot;h&quot; suitable for boys or girls?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Christian names starting with &quot;h&quot; include both boy names, girl names, and some unisex options. On each name card, you can find the gender classification. Use our filters to browse exclusively Christian boy names or Christian girl names beginning with &quot;h&quot;.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">How do I find the origin of a Christian name starting with &quot;h&quot;?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Every name on NameVerse includes its origin — whether Arabic, Persian, Urdu, Sanskrit, Hebrew, Latin, or Greek. Simply click on any Christian name starting with &quot;h&quot; to access its full profile, including origin, meaning, pronunciation, lucky number, and lucky stone.</div></details><details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-100 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors list-none\"><span class=\"pr-4\">Can I save my favourite Christian baby names starting with &quot;h&quot;?</span><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-lg font-light\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm border-t border-emerald-50 pt-4\">Yes! NameVerse allows you to save favourite baby names using the heart icon on each name card. Create a personalised shortlist of your top Christian names beginning with &quot;h&quot; to compare and share with family.</div></details></div></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Find the Perfect <!-- -->Christian<!-- --> Baby Name Starting with “<!-- -->h<!-- -->”</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">Choosing a baby name is one of the most meaningful decisions a parent can make. NameVerse provides a comprehensive, curated database of <!-- -->Christian<!-- --> names starting with “<!-- -->h<!-- -->”, each with its authentic meaning, cultural origin, and spiritual significance. Whether you are looking for a traditional <!-- -->Christian<!-- --> name or a modern variation, our database helps you find the ideal name for your child.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Browse other letters or switch between Islamic, Hindu, and Christian name collections to find the name that best represents your heritage and values. Every name on NameVerse is research-backed and presented with care for accuracy and cultural authenticity.</p></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 pb-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3\">Explore More Ways to Browse</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-all text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700\" href=\"/names/christian/categories/modern/1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-grid3x3 lucide-grid-3x3 w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M